            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/765040/extras/aff34cc71718340b60e58cb3faac02b6.avif?t=1793804799\" width=1179 height=100 /></span></p><br>Mazing TD combines classic tower defense gameplay with maze-building strategy and RPG-inspired progression. Build your defenses, manage resources, and stop waves of enemies from reaching their destination.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/765040/extras/f0817b5ffd98bec9a6d2837586a97569.avif?t=1793804799\" width=1178 height=468 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/765040/extras/eb28ed9bb0b8e09f2d323db3fa216d36.avif?t=1793804799\" width=1179 height=100 /></span></p><br>Shape enemy paths and create intricate mazes to maximize your defenses. Every tower placement matters, and every battlefield presents new strategic opportunities.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/765040/extras/a2965a0def91d47dc4c54a2b6a0c7550.poster.avif?t=1793804799\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/765040/extras/a2965a0def91d47dc4c54a2b6a0c7550.webm?t=1793804799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/765040/extras/a2965a0def91d47dc4c54a2b6a0c7550.mp4?t=1793804799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/765040/extras/9423db